1. The petitioner is before this Court seeking for the following reliefs:
a. Issue an appropriate writ or order or direction directing the respondent-authorities to allot site measuring 30 feet x 35 feet situated within the limits of fourth respondent in Katha No.4167/4620 as assured forthwith by executing the registered conveyance deed;
b.

In the alternative issue an appropriate writ or order or direction directing the respondent authorities to pay the compensation to the petitioner under the provisions of Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition,
Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013 in respect of the land measuring 10,000 square feet in Sy.No.21 of V.G.Doddi, Nayakanahalli, Madabal Hobli, Magadi C.Mallanna vs State Of Karnataka on 18 April, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/92618509/
